# Rinoa Heartilly (CR 603.6a, 603.2, 611.2c): when she enters Bot1 gets Angelo, a legendary 1/1 green and white Dog. When she attacks
# on turn 3, another target creature Bot1 controls gets +1/+1 for each creature Bot1 controls: Rinoa, Angelo and Bot1's Ornithopter
# are three, Bot2's Ornithopter is not counted, so Angelo becomes 4/4 until end of turn. Rinoa herself and Bot2's Ornithopter are
# refused as targets; Rinoa is not pumped and deals her 4 damage to Bot2 (16).

